title: Palo Alto: System Info (XML API)
agents: palo_alto_api
catalog: hw/network/palo_alto
license: GPLv3
distribution: kuhn-ruess
description:
 This check reports the general system information of a Palo Alto Networks
 firewall as read from {show system info} through the PAN-OS XML API: the model,
 the PAN-OS software version, the serial number, the content versions (App-ID,
 threat, antivirus, URL filtering, GlobalProtect client) and the uptime.

 The service is always {OK}; it goes {CRIT} only if the agent reports an error.
 The uptime is published as a metric.

discovery:
 One service is created when system information is available.
